    <detaileddescription>
<para>Expression that represents an update to a storage location.</para><para>The left-hand-side must be a register or memory location, and the right-hand-side is an expression that will be computed and stored at that location. Pre-updates happen before an instruction is evaluated. </para>    </detaileddescription>
